Package: sshgo
Version: 1.0.2
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SSHGo Maintainers <41820848+Pengxuan-Zhu-Phys@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: zsh, openssh-client (>= 1:8.9)
Recommends: pv
Suggests: libsecret-tools, python3-yaml
Description: SSH connection picker and file transfer helper
 SSHGo provides a server picker, SSH file transfers and speed tests.
 It reads existing OpenSSH configuration and can optionally use a
 desktop Secret Service keyring for server passwords.
